::udp-reliable:: UDP retransmits lost segments. {F}

::show-run:: Which command shows the running configuration? {
  =show running-config
  =show run
}

::match-ports:: Match each protocol to its port. {
  =SSH -> 22
  =HTTPS -> 443
  =RDP -> 3389
}

